Subject: [PATCH] webrtcbin: reuse matching transceivers for requested sink pads

The 1.24 predicate rejects intersecting caps and creates an extra
unnegotiated transceiver. WPE then connects media to that transceiver:
ICE/DTLS succeeds, but no negotiated RTP stream carries the media.
Align the caps predicate with GStreamer 1.26.0:
https://github.com/GStreamer/gstreamer/blob/1.26.0/subprojects/gst-plugins-bad/ext/webrtc/gstwebrtcbin.c

--- a/ext/webrtc/gstwebrtcbin.c
+++ b/ext/webrtc/gstwebrtcbin.c
@@ -8288,5 +8288,5 @@
       GST_OBJECT_LOCK (tmptrans);
       has_matching_caps = (caps && tmptrans->codec_preferences &&
-          !gst_caps_can_intersect (caps, tmptrans->codec_preferences));
+          gst_caps_can_intersect (caps, tmptrans->codec_preferences));
       GST_OBJECT_UNLOCK (tmptrans);
       /* Ignore transceivers with non-matching caps */
